---
interface Props {
  heading?: string | null;
}
const { heading = 'Fog between the panes or condensation on the room side?' } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="glass-diagram">
  {heading && <figcaption class="diagram-heading">{heading}</figcaption>}
  <p class="diagram-intro">The location of the moisture tells you what is wrong. <strong>Inside the sealed gap = failed glass.</strong> <strong>On the room-side surface = condensation.</strong></p>

  <div class="glass-grid">
    <article class="glass-card glass-fail">
      <header><span class="status-dot">A</span><div><h3>Failed insulated glass</h3><p>Fog is trapped between the panes.</p></div></header>
      <svg class="glass-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 360" role="img" aria-label="Cross-section of insulated glass with two panes, a sealed cavity between them containing moisture droplets, and a failed seal marked in red.">
        <defs><linearGradient id="glass-fade-a" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".08"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".02"/></linearGradient></defs>
        <rect x="24" y="36" width="512" height="286" rx="18" class="glass-frame" />
        <rect x="120" y="76" width="30" height="200" rx="4" class="pane" />
        <rect x="410" y="76" width="30" height="200" rx="4" class="pane" />
        <rect x="150" y="88" width="260" height="176" rx="8" fill="url(#glass-fade-a)" class="cavity" />
        <rect x="150" y="78" width="260" height="18" rx="6" class="spacer-bad" />
        <rect x="150" y="258" width="260" height="18" rx="6" class="spacer-bad" />
        <g class="fog"><circle cx="205" cy="126" r="12"/><circle cx="248" cy="178" r="18"/><circle cx="301" cy="136" r="13"/><circle cx="350" cy="204" r="20"/><circle cx="224" cy="226" r="10"/><circle cx="323" cy="242" r="11"/></g>
        <path d="M164 84 H396" class="seal-crack" />
        <line x1="436" y1="110" x2="492" y2="86" class="leader" />
        <text x="500" y="82" class="callout callout-end">ROOM SIDE</text>
        <line x1="410" y1="176" x2="474" y2="176" class="leader leader-bad" />
        <text x="482" y="172" class="callout callout-end">FOG IS HERE</text>
        <text x="482" y="190" class="caption caption-end">between panes</text>
        <line x1="150" y1="304" x2="150" y2="332" class="leader" />
        <text x="150" y="350" class="caption">outer pane</text>
        <line x1="280" y1="304" x2="280" y2="332" class="leader" />
        <text x="280" y="350" class="caption">sealed gap</text>
        <line x1="410" y1="304" x2="410" y2="332" class="leader" />
        <text x="410" y="350" class="caption">inner pane</text>
      </svg>
      <div class="glass-answer glass-answer-bad"><strong>What it means:</strong> the sealed unit has failed. A cloth cannot reach this moisture.</div>
    </article>

    <article class="glass-card glass-ok">
      <header><span class="status-dot">B</span><div><h3>Room-side condensation</h3><p>Water is sitting on the inside surface.</p></div></header>
      <svg class="glass-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 360" role="img" aria-label="Cross-section of sound insulated glass with a sealed gas-filled cavity and water droplets forming on the room-side surface of the inner pane.">
        <defs><linearGradient id="glass-fade-b" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".08"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity=".02"/></linearGradient></defs>
        <rect x="24" y="36" width="512" height="286" rx="18" class="glass-frame" />
        <rect x="120" y="76" width="30" height="200" rx="4" class="pane" />
        <rect x="410" y="76" width="30" height="200" rx="4" class="pane" />
        <rect x="150" y="88" width="260" height="176" rx="8" fill="url(#glass-fade-b)" class="cavity" />
        <rect x="150" y="78" width="260" height="18" rx="6" class="spacer-good" />
        <rect x="150" y="258" width="260" height="18" rx="6" class="spacer-good" />
        <text x="280" y="176" class="gas-label">INSULATING GAS</text>
        <text x="280" y="196" class="gas-sub">sealed cavity remains intact</text>
        <g class="drops"><circle cx="450" cy="118" r="9"/><circle cx="474" cy="148" r="6"/><circle cx="448" cy="176" r="7"/><circle cx="482" cy="208" r="9"/><circle cx="452" cy="240" r="6"/></g>
        <path d="M440 88 V276" class="room-line" />
        <line x1="450" y1="126" x2="492" y2="126" class="leader leader-ok" />
        <text x="500" y="122" class="callout callout-end">CONDENSATION</text>
        <text x="500" y="140" class="caption caption-end">on room-side face</text>
        <line x1="436" y1="284" x2="492" y2="310" class="leader" />
        <text x="500" y="314" class="callout callout-end">CAN WIPE OFF</text>
        <line x1="150" y1="304" x2="150" y2="332" class="leader" />
        <text x="150" y="350" class="caption">outer pane</text>
        <line x1="280" y1="304" x2="280" y2="332" class="leader" />
        <text x="280" y="350" class="caption">sealed gap</text>
        <line x1="410" y1="304" x2="410" y2="332" class="leader" />
        <text x="410" y="350" class="caption">inner pane</text>
      </svg>
      <div class="glass-answer glass-answer-ok"><strong>What it means:</strong> the insulated unit can still be sound. Moisture is on the room side, so humidity and surface temperature matter.</div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="wipe-test"><span class="wipe-icon" aria-hidden="true">↔</span><strong>The quickest test:</strong> wipe the room-side glass. Clear after wiping? Condensation. Still hazy between panes? The seal has failed.</div>
</figure>

<style>
  .glass-diagram{margin:0}.diagram-heading{display:block;margin:0 0 var(--space-2xs);font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-display)}.diagram-intro{margin:0 0 var(--space-l);max-width:72ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}.diagram-intro strong{color:var(--ink)}
  .glass-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--space-m)}.glass-card{padding:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.35rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--paper-raised)}
  .glass-card header{display:flex;gap:var(--space-s);align-items:center;margin-bottom:var(--space-s)}.status-dot{width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-weight:700}.glass-fail .status-dot{background:var(--danger)}.glass-ok .status-dot{background:var(--accent)}.glass-card h3{margin:0 0 .15rem;font-size:var(--step-1)}.glass-card header p{margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}
  .glass-svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;background:var(--paper-sunk);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)}.glass-frame{fill:none;stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:3}.pane{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 15%,transparent);stroke:var(--ink-soft);stroke-width:2}.cavity{stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:1}.spacer-bad{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--danger) 18%,transparent);stroke:var(--danger);stroke-width:2}.spacer-good{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 18%,transparent);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2}.fog circle{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 34%,transparent)}.drops circle{fill:var(--accent-ink)}.seal-crack{stroke:var(--danger);stroke-width:5;stroke-dasharray:9 7}.room-line{stroke:var(--accent-ink);stroke-width:4;stroke-dasharray:4 6}.leader{stroke:var(--ink-faint);stroke-width:2}.leader-bad{stroke:var(--danger)}.leader-ok{stroke:var(--accent)}.callout{fill:var(--ink);font-family:Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.08em}.callout-end{text-anchor:start}.caption{fill:var(--ink-soft);font-family:Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:550}.caption-end{text-anchor:start}.gas-label{fill:var(--ink);font-family:Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:750;text-anchor:middle;letter-spacing:.08em}.gas-sub{fill:var(--ink-faint);font-family:Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;text-anchor:middle}.glass-answer{margin-top:var(--space-s);padding:.75rem .9rem;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:var(--step--1);color:var(--ink-soft)}.glass-answer-bad{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--danger) 9%,transparent);border-left:3px solid var(--danger)}.glass-answer-ok{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 10%,transparent);border-left:3px solid var(--accent)}.glass-answer strong{color:var(--ink)}
  .wipe-test{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--space-s);margin-top:var(--space-m);padding:var(--space-s) var(--space-m);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:var(--step--1);color:var(--ink-soft)}.wipe-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.4rem;height:2.4rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-size:1.2rem}.wipe-test strong{color:var(--ink)}
  @media(max-width:800px){.glass-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
